  <jpcrp030000-asr_E00769-000:NotesRegardingBusinessStructureImprovementExpensesTextBlock contextRef="CurrentYearDuration_NonConsolidatedMember">
&lt;p style="margin-left: 36px; text-align: left"&gt;※４　事業構造改善費用&lt;/p&gt;
